# Heating in the silicon layer itself, 1 um to each side of the core: no cladding in between.
# Reference: the same mesh solved with a sparse direct solver in SciPy.
title Doped silicon heater in the waveguide layer
grid dx=0.25 dy=0.25
window width=60 ymin=-10 ymax=5
layer si -10 0
layer sio2 0 5
rect si -0.25 0.25 2 2.25
rect si 1 2 2 2.25
rect si -2 -1 2 2.25
heater right xmin=1 xmax=2 ymin=2 ymax=2.25 power=0.05
heater left xmin=-2 xmax=-1 ymin=2 ymax=2.25 power=0.05
probe wg xmin=-0.25 xmax=0.25 ymin=2 ymax=2.25
expect response wg right 147.765788 1e-7
expect response wg left 147.765788 1e-7
expect temperature wg 14.7765788 1e-7
expect peak 19.9807743 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 14400
